# "It's an enchantment" sets its card types and keeps the subtypes of the one it still has (CR 205.1a): Bot1's Phantasmal
# Image copies Enduring Curiosity on turn 3. On turn 4 Bot2's Lightning Bolt targets the Image, which sacrifices itself; the
# copy's ability returns the Phantasmal Image card as an enchantment, and it enters as a copy of Bot2's Summon: Fenrir (an
# Enchantment Creature - Saga Wolf): an Enchantment - Saga, its Wolf and Illusion types gone with the creature type.

